	(text "LED_1 supply: D29 drops LED_1's VDD to about 4.3 V, so its input threshold (0.7 x VDD = ~3.0 V) accepts the RP2040's 3.3 V data. LED_1 re-drives the data for the rest of the chain at full level."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 201.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fde44ee5-e688-4c72-9ff0-a754d07b3b79")
	)
	(text "RGB LED chain: data flows LED_1 -> LED_32 (left to right, row by row). One 100 nF cap per LED, placed next to its LED on the PCB."
